Package: elan-fingerprint-04f3-0c4b
Version: 1.0.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libfprint-2-tod1, fprintd
Maintainer: Local Administrator <root@localhost>
Description: ELAN 04f3:0c4b TOD fingerprint driver
 Provides the proprietary ELAN TOD driver required for USB fingerprint
 reader 04f3:0c4b together with an isolated libcrypto.so.1.1 compatibility
 library under /opt/elan-fingerprint/lib.
 .
 The legacy OpenSSL library is used only through the driver's RUNPATH.
 PAM configuration is not modified.
